{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2023-03-09 11:00:00', 'title': 'LINCOLN FINANCIAL NETWORK WELCOMES PAIR OF HERITAGE FINANCIAL CONSULTANTS FINANCIAL PROFESSIONALS', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LINCOLN FINANCIAL NETWORK (LFN), THE RETAIL WEALTH MANAGEMENT AFFILIATE OF LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP (NYSE: LNC), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT FINANCIAL PLANNERS ANDY ANDREWS AND JOE DANKOWSKI OF HERITAGE FINANCIAL CONSULTANTS (HFC), LLC HAVE JOINED THE FIRM.'}